msgid "Lynbro Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Lynbro Cookie Consent"

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-cookie-consent"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-cookie-consent"

msgid ""
"Free, multilingual, fully configurable cookie consent banner — GDPR/ePrivacy"
" and Google Consent Mode v2 ready, with no pageview limits."
msgstr ""
"Banner tal-kunsens tal-cookies b’xejn, multilingwi u kompletament "
"konfigurabbli — lest għall-GDPR/ePrivacy u Google Consent Mode v2, mingħajr "
"limiti ta’ pageviews."

msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Ottimizzatur tal-Immaġini"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Aqleb għal WebP u AVIF, daħħal immaġini kbar fid-daqs korrett u uża lazy-"
"load — kollox fuq is-server tiegħek."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "AI Studio"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Ikteb u illustra postijiet bl-AI fuq OpenAI key tiegħek — bi prezz kost, "
"mingħajr credits bejn."

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitiċi"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Analitiċi self-hosted mingħajr cookies u b'funnels. Id-dejta tal-viżitaturi "
"qatt ma titlaq mid-database tiegħek."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tags"

msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel u aktar mingħajr kodiċi — kull tag "
"jistenna l-kunsens."

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formoli"

msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Formoli b'entrati salvati b'xejn u mingħajr limitu, loġika kondizzjonali "
"vverifikata fuq is-server, u webhooks iffirmati."

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Ivverifika"

msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a"
" one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Aqbad dominji ta' email żbaljati u numri ta' telefon ħżiena, u ivverifikahom"
" b'kodiku wieħed permezz ta' email jew SMS."

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Cache"

msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Tindif affidabbli għal nginx FastCGI cache u Redis object cache, b'kull "
"tindif ivverifikat kontra l-cache innifsu."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Ittraduċi"

msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Iċċaqlaq is-sit tiegħek f'diversi lingwi, b'traduzzjoni awtomatika fuq "
"OpenAI key tiegħek — xejn imkejjel, xejn mibjugħ bil-kelma."

msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Shield"

msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes"
" and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Headers ta' sigurtà, HTTPS b'HSTS, firewall żgħir kontra probes ta' "
"injection u swiċċijiet ta' hardening li kull sit jeħtieġ."

msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Anti-Spam"

msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolli ta' spam li jaħdmu fuq is-server tiegħek. L-ebda kont, l-ebda "
"abbonament, kull blokk jispjega għaliex — u messaġġ miżmum qatt ma jintilef."

msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Login Guard"

msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with"
" three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Mexxi wp-login.php, illimita tentattivi falluti u żid two-factor ibbażat fuq"
" app — b'tliet modi kif terġa' tidħol."

msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject"
" button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"Banner tal-GDPR u ePrivacy b'Consent Mode v2, buttuna Reject prominenti daqs"
" l-oħra u 35 lingwa."

msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Reġistru tal-Attività"

msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Min għamel xiex, meta u minn fejn — miktub fuq is-server tiegħek, jista' "
"jiġi mfittxet, esportat, u mħassar skont l-iskeda tiegħek."

msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Żamma tad-Dejta"

msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a"
" schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Sib fejn id-dejta personali tinsab fil-fatt fid-database tiegħek, imbagħad "
"ħassarha skont skeda — b'prova niexfa qabel kull tħassir."

msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Iċċekkja kull paġna kontra WCAG 2.2 AA u issewwi dak li jista' jiġi rranġat "
"b'mod sigur. L-ebda overlay, l-ebda limitu ta' paġni."

msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"SEO ħafif b'schema LocalBusiness b'xejn, sitemaps u social cards. Xejn ma "
"jibgħat dejta lura."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP Mailer"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"Emails ta' WordPress permezz tas-server SMTP tiegħek — b'reġistru tal-"
"emails, tibgħat mill-ġdid, konnessjoni ta' backup u twissijiet ta' "
"falliment."

msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Social Feed"

msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Feed ta' Instagram fuq is-sit tiegħek mingħajr Meta token maħżun "
"f'WordPress."

msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Cache tar-Reviżjonijiet"

msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Uri r-reviżjonijiet tiegħek ta' Google mingħajr ma ddaħħal API key "
"f'WordPress."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Links"

msgid ""
"Find broken links and manage redirects on your own server, with the reason "
"for every verdict."
msgstr ""
"Sib links miksura u immaniġġja redirects fuq is-server tiegħek, bir-raġuni "
"għal kull deċiżjoni."

msgid "Danadresse Autofill"
msgstr "Danadresse Autofill"

msgid ""
"Danish address autocomplete and validation for WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable and EDD."
msgstr ""
"Autocomplete u validazzjoni ta' indirizzi Daniżi għal WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable u EDD."

msgid "Soge Lookup"
msgstr "Soge Lookup"

msgid ""
"Look up Danish vehicles (DMR) and companies (CVR) by plate, VIN or CVR "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Fittex vetturi Daniżi (DMR) u kumpaniji (CVR) b'numru tal-pjanċa, VIN jew "
"numru CVR."

msgid "CVR Checkout"
msgstr "CVR Checkout"

msgid ""
"Danish B2B checkout for WooCommerce: CVR company autofill, CVR/EU-VAT (VIES)"
" validation and an EAN/GLN field."
msgstr ""
"Checkout B2B Daniż għal WooCommerce: awto-mili CVR tal-kumpanija, "
"validazzjoni CVR/EU-VAT (VIES) u kamp EAN/GLN."

msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Tbaħħir Daniż"

msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Għażla ta' pickup point b'xejn għal PostNord u GLS Denmark fil-checkout ta' "
"WooCommerce, flimkien ma' metodi ta' tbaħħir nodfa."

msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "API Auth"

msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON Web Tokens għall-REST API li tista' tħassar verament, b'skopi u ġurnal "
"ta' rifjuti."

msgid ""
"Cookiebot keeps its banner texts in your Cookiebot account, so only its "
"categories can be brought over. The banner texts here start from Lynbro's "
"own, translated defaults."
msgstr ""
"Cookiebot iżomm it-testi tal-banner fil-kont Cookiebot tiegħek, għalhekk "
"jistgħu jiġu importati biss il-kategoriji tiegħu. It-testi tal-banner hawn "
"jibdew mill-verżjonijiet awtomatiċi ta’ Lynbro, tradotti."

msgid ""
"Borlabs Cookie keeps its settings in its own format, which is not read. Its "
"categories map to Preferences, Statistics and Marketing; set your texts on "
"the Languages tab."
msgstr ""
"Borlabs Cookie iżomm is-settings fil-format tiegħu stess, li ma jinqara "
"xejn. Il-kategoriji tiegħu jikkorrispondu għal Preferenzi, Statistika u "
"Marketing; issettja t-testi tiegħek fit-tab Lingwi."

msgid "%s is active, so Lynbro Cookie Consent stays silent."
msgstr "%s huwa attiv, għalhekk Lynbro Cookie Consent jibqa’ sieket."

msgid ""
"Visitors see one banner, not two: ours is not shown, blocks no scripts and "
"keeps no consent records while the other plugin is active."
msgstr ""
"Il-viżitaturi jaraw banner wieħed, mhux tnejn: tagħna ma jintweriex, ma "
"jimblokka l-ebda skript u ma jżomm l-ebda rekord tal-kunsens waqt li "
"l-plugin l-ieħor ikun attiv."

msgid "See what can be brought over"
msgstr "Ara x’jista’ jiġi importat"

msgid "Banner texts in: %s"
msgstr "Testi tal-banner f’: %s"

msgid "Categories: %s"
msgstr "Kategoriji: %s"

msgid "Policy link: %s"
msgstr "Link għall-politika: %s"

msgid "Bring over the texts and categories from %s"
msgstr "Importa t-testi u l-kategoriji minn %s"

msgid ""
"Nothing of the other plugin is changed. After bringing them over, check the "
"result here, then deactivate the other plugin: our banner takes over from "
"that moment."
msgstr ""
"Ma tinbidel xejn fil-plugin l-ieħor. Wara li timportahom, iċċekkja "
"r-riżultat hawn, imbagħad iddiżattiva l-plugin l-ieħor: minn dak il-mument, "
"il-banner tagħna jieħu postu."

msgid "Booking"
msgstr "Prenotazzjonijiet"

msgid ""
"Appointment booking for one business on your own server: services, staff, "
"schedules, reminders and a one-click move from Amelia."
msgstr ""
"Prenotazzjoni ta’ appuntamenti għal negozju wieħed fuq is-server tiegħek "
"stess: servizzi, staff, skedi, tfakkiriet u trasferiment b’klikk waħda minn "
"Amelia."

msgid "Contact Buttons"
msgstr "Buttuni ta’ Kuntatt"

msgid ""
"WhatsApp, Messenger, phone and live chat in one fast button — chat scripts "
"load only when a visitor asks."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp, Messenger, telefon u chat dirett f’buttuna waħda veloċi — "
"l-iskripts taċ-chat jitgħabbew biss meta viżitatur jitlobhom."

msgid "Site Check"
msgstr "Iċċekkjar tas-Sit"

msgid ""
"A free website check for your visitors: HTTPS, headers, cookies before "
"consent, accessibility, SPF/DKIM/DMARC — report on screen."
msgstr ""
"Iċċekkjar b’xejn tal-websajt għall-viżitaturi tiegħek: HTTPS, headers, "
"cookies qabel il-kunsens, aċċessibbiltà, SPF/DKIM/DMARC — rapport fuq "
"l-iskrin."

msgid "Newsletter"
msgstr "Newsletter"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted newsletters with safe sending: consent records, a test after the"
" last edit and approval by typing the exact recipient count."
msgstr ""
"Newsletters ospitati fuq is-server tiegħek b’kunsinna sigura: rekords tal-"
"kunsens, test wara l-aħħar editjar u approvazzjoni billi ddaħħal in-numru "
"eżatt tar-riċevituri."

msgid "Emoji images from WordPress.org"
msgstr "Immaġnijiet tal-emoji minn WordPress.org"

msgid ""
"Do not load emoji images from WordPress.org; visitors see emoji in their own"
" device font."
msgstr ""
"Tgħabbix immaġnijiet tal-emoji minn WordPress.org; il-viżitaturi jaraw "
"l-emoji bil-font tat-tagħmir tagħhom."

msgid ""
"WordPress swaps emoji for images hosted on WordPress.org in browsers without"
" an emoji font, which sends the visitor's IP address to WordPress.org before"
" any consent. On by default; the admin and the editor are not affected."
msgstr ""
"WordPress jissostitwixxi l-emoji b’immaġnijiet minn WordPress.org f’brawżers"
" li ma għandhomx font tal-emoji, u b’hekk jibgħat l-indirizz IP tal-"
"viżitatur lil WordPress.org qabel ma jagħti kwalunkwe kunsens. Din l-għażla "
"hija attivata awtomatikament; ma taffettwax lill-amministratur u lill-"
"editur."

msgid "Remember the choice for (days)"
msgstr "Żomm l-għażla għal (jiem)"

msgid ""
"Accepting and rejecting are both remembered this long; after that the banner"
" asks again. 1 to 365 days, 365 by default."
msgstr ""
"Kemm l-aċċettazzjoni kif ukoll ir-rifjut jinżammu mfakkra għal dan it-tul; "
"wara, il-banner jerġa’ jistaqsi. Minn jum sa 365 jum, 365 jum b’mod "
"awtomatiku."

msgid ""
"The banner speaks the language of the page. When the page language is not "
"one of the offered languages, show the banner in the visitor’s browser "
"language instead."
msgstr ""
"Il-banner juża l-lingwa tal-paġna. Meta l-lingwa tal-paġna ma tkunx waħda "
"mil-lingwi offruti, uri l-banner fil-lingwa tal-browser tal-viżitatur "
"minflok."

msgid "Show more"
msgstr "Uri aktar"

msgid "\"Show more\" toggle under the shortened text on phones"
msgstr "Iswiċċ “Uri aktar” taħt it-test imqassar fuq it-telefowns"

msgid "Show less"
msgstr "Uri inqas"

msgid "\"Show less\" toggle on phones"
msgstr "Iswiċċ “Uri inqas” fuq it-telefowns"

msgid ""
"Like the site (theme colours, font and corners; light and dark from the "
"theme)"
msgstr "Bħas-sit (kuluri tat-tema, tipa u kantunieri; ċar u skur mit-tema)"
